A-NAS does not vendor dsh-pet's voice (shared/voice.ts runs edge-tts through the Harness host):
the card no longer reads a say leaf aloud, and the speech bubble no longer waits for or shows
a reading. The bubble keeps its plain timing (shared/bubble-hold.ts).

